✅ 好的，我幫你檢查。
目前你查出來的 CustPurposeOfAcc 值只有 01，這是合法的（對應「儲蓄」）。

建議：一次檢查所有不合法的 CustPurposeOfAcc
請執行下面這條 SQL，會直接幫你找出不在允許清單裡的資料：
SELECT 
    b.CustPurposeOfAcc,
    COUNT(*) as 筆數,
    a.NEW_CIF_KEY,
    a.SOURCE_CIF_KEY
FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP a
JOIN Customer_Migrate_buffer b ON a.SOURCE_CIF_KEY = b.CIF_KEY
JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT c ON c.CIF_KEY = a.NEW_CIF_KEY
WHERE b.CustPurposeOfAcc IS NOT NULL
  AND b.CustPurposeOfAcc NOT IN ('01','11','10','04','06','03','15','38','99','21')
GROUP BY b.CustPurposeOfAcc, a.NEW_CIF_KEY, a.SOURCE_CIF_KEY
ORDER BY b.CustPurposeOfAcc;

如果你只想看「有哪些不合法的值」：
SELECT DISTINCT b.CustPurposeOfAcc
FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP a
JOIN Customer_Migrate_buffer b ON a.SOURCE_CIF_KEY = b.CIF_KEY
WHERE b.CustPurposeOfAcc IS NOT NULL
  AND b.CustPurposeOfAcc NOT IN ('01','11','10','04','06','03','15','38','99','21')
ORDER BY b.CustPurposeOfAcc;

